WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.460
This one is about how a page feels.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.750
People will tell
you a page is overwhelming.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.837
They will never tell
you which law of design it breaks.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.720
Here is the same menu, twice.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.625
The more choices at once,
the longer it takes to pick one.

6
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.360
That is Hick's Law.

7
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.400
The suite knows 30 laws
of user experience.

8
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.012
8 of them can be checked straight
from the page, in a second.

9
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.480
The secret: it counts
what a person sees at one moment.

10
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.480
A phone menu and a desktop
menu are never added together.

11
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.080
It is a fast check, not a designer.

12
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.950
Whether the page answers
the right question stays your call.

13
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

14
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
